{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"respirable-trapezial-ekaltadeta","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`rebar store fsck` reports 1 counted `ORPHAN_EVENT` on ticket 77b6-868f-f4bd-461f: `1793763291917454423-f07d2f27-191e-4bd7-9091-1b10efb7ed38-TAG_DELTA.json` predates SNAPSHOT `4febf54c` and is not in its `source_event_uuids`, so the tag change is skipped on replay. The code cause is fixed under bug stormproof-stormy-toad; this task is the separate operator data repair of the existing row.\n\n## Approach\n\nAn operator runs `rebar store fsck --repair-snapshots --dry-run`, checks the 77b6 plan rebuilds from CREATE, LINK and the TAG_DELTA, then runs `rebar store fsck --repair-snapshots` once on one clone so the rebuilt SNAPSHOT pushes to `origin/tickets`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `rebar store fsck --output json` reports 0 `orphan_event` rows for 77b6-868f-f4bd-461f on the operator clone and on the production MCP clone.","id":"98bc-13ff-2f80-48ba","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["tracker","compaction"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Repair the orphaned TAG_DELTA on 77b6-868f"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1793790343420519001,"uuid":"4764950c-32be-49bd-be0c-1b97d5b57293"}